# Dev test: growing an Eye tier by tier with the projector's survival auto-place (docs/recording.md). Not a showcase.
kit eye 1 3600,5,4000 gen 5 name ta
place bts.eyeOfHarmony 3900,5,4000 facing north name tb
hologram tb build tier 1

scene a
  caption kit gen 5, then survival tier 2
  goto ta.c+-80,30,-80 look ta.c+0,-8,0
  hologram ta survival tier 2 budget 6 every 1 tail 1 max 20

scene b
  caption creative build tier 1, then survival tier 2
  goto tb.c+-80,30,-80 look tb.c+0,-8,0
  hologram tb survival tier 2 budget 6 every 1 tail 1 max 20

scene c
  caption creative build tier 3 over b
  hologram tb build tier 3
  hold 1
